it's about the passion  not the product if you want to have  success as an entrepreneur you're  thinking about launching a new business  it's always going to be more successful  if you love what you're doing  it doesn't matter what you're selling  but it matters that you  love your business it's the number one  most important rule in business  is that you love what you do if you look  at famous entrepreneurs any famous on  look at how they got started  it was because they had a deep love for  what they're doing and the people who  start a business just trying to make  money they never do  they never do they burn their money  their time the resources  going in the wrong direction because  they weren't passionate about it from  the start you have  to love what you're doing i get asked  all the time  by entrepreneurs who write into me and  they say evan i'm looking at this  product or this product  what do you think which one should i go  with doesn't matter to me  my opinion doesn't matter which one do  you love more  where can you add value that's the one  you'll be more successful with  you don't start a business just by  looking at  the market research and saying this is a  growing industry  and this is a dying industry so we  should focus on this growing industry  what's more important is which which  industry are you more passionate about  because you can have a lot more success  in a dying industry that you're  passionate about  because you can reinvigorate it then a  booming industry  that you have no passion in you too many  people just jump into this because they  think hey i can make a lot of money and  they never do  so you have to follow your passion this  comes as a result  of a question i got from one of my  newsletter readers love you guys  irene who wrote in the say evan i'm  interested in starting an online  business but unsure what products i  should feature  here's what i'm looking at jewelry kid  stuff outdoor high-end jewelry  electronics larger ladies wear what  advice do you have for me  and this is a common question i get  asked all the time  it doesn't matter if you're selling  high-end jewelry  larger ladies clothing electronics  all of those make money online and they  will continue to make money online and  they can make money for you  the biggest thing is which one do you  actually care about  where is your passion live where can you  add value  where can you tell a personal story  right if you're recommending an  electronic product  why do you have a connection to it can  you tell me why this one is better than  another one  can you be a trusted expert can i like  you  know you feel like you're giving me the  truth feel like you're giving me a lot  of extra value  by explaining the products to me that's  why i'm gonna buy from you  if you're just throwing up a website  like everybody else has selling the same  products that everybody else has you're  not gonna have success  so all of those ideas can work for irene  and if you have a lot of  similar questions if you're trying to  figure out what product to sell for your  business  any product can work but you have to be  passionate about it  if you are deeply passionate about it  know that there are other people in the  world  who share that passion and who will want  to buy from you  who is going to be the leading expert  who loves this business  who bleeds this business so you can see  their passion  seep out of it that's the guy i want to  buy from  so it's always the passion not the  product  believe for those of you watching if you  have a story about how you followed your  passion  and helped that translate into a  successful business i'd love to hear  from you please leave a comment below  your story can also help inspire other  people who are watching and reading so  please share your story you like this  video thumbs up below  click on my face subscribe to the  channel thank you so much i'll see you  soon
 

